    "title": "How to get to Coachella 2026 and what roads are closed",
    "text": "TRAFFICHow to get to Coachella 2026 and what roads are closed Jennifer CortezPalm Springs Desert SunApril 7, 2026, 1:29 p.m. PTAs the Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival returns to Indio for its 25th iteration, and with set times for Weekend 1 now out, visitors and locals alike need to map out their days and how they'll get around the desert.Drivers, however, shouldn't expect to be speed demons.Although 40,000 festivalgoers will be shuttled in and out daily across the Coachella Valley, major road closures and congestion are still expected around the Empire Polo Club in Indio.",
